1. Saved searches, reports, and alerts

All three are the same object type. Distinguish them with is_scheduled, alert_type, and actions.

spl
| rest /servicesNS/-/-/saved/searches count=0 splunk_server=*
| where 'eai:acl.app'="<index>"
| table title, eai:acl.app, eai:acl.owner, eai:acl.sharing, disabled,
        is_scheduled, cron_schedule, alert_type, alert_condition, actions,
        dispatch.earliest_time, dispatch.latest_time, description, search
2. Dashboards

eai:data holds the full definition — SimpleXML as XML, Dashboard Studio as JSON.

spl
| rest /servicesNS/-/-/data/ui/views count=0 splunk_server=*
| where 'eai:acl.app'="<index>"
| table title, label, eai:acl.app, eai:acl.owner, eai:acl.sharing, disabled, eai:data
